ere assessed using Pearson’s chi-square test.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"P-values <0.05 were considered statistically significant.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The IHI for each Chicago zip code was calculated and tertiles were derived.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"p-values are for a chi-square test for a global difference in a characteristic\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Analyses were conducted using SAS (version 9.4; SAS Institute).\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}